{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "长方形的面积与周长",
    "goals": [
      "理解面积是用单位正方形覆盖区域的度量",
      "建立每行方格数、行数与方格总数的乘法关系",
      "掌握长方形面积公式与平方单位的使用",
      "区分长方形的面积（内部覆盖）与周长（一周长度）"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "直观感知：利用 1cm² 单位正方形网格填充长方形",
      "行与列的递推：从按行计数自然过渡到乘法算式",
      "对比辨析：同步显示边界周长与内部面积，防止概念混淆"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 4,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 8,
        "label": "长（每行方格数）",
        "unit": "cm",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "initial": 3,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 8,
        "label": "宽（行数）",
        "unit": "cm",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 1
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "建立面积的概念：用边长为1厘米的单位正方形覆盖平面区域的大小",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "rectangle_unit_square_array"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "当我们想要测量一个平面图形的大小时，本质上是在看它能被多少个标准的小正方形铺满。这就是面积的概念。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "rectangle_unit_square_array",
                  "numbers": [
                    1,
                    2
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 2
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "什么是面积？",
                  "items": [
                    "面积表示用单位正方形覆盖一个平面区域的多少。",
                    "边长为 1cm 的正方形，面积是 1 平方厘米（1 cm²）。"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦于单位正方形网格",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "看屏幕上的图形，它由边长为 1 厘米的单位正方形铺成。数一数这些方格的数量，就能知道这个区域的大小。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 1,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "调整每行方格数（长）为 5，观察画面中正方形的排列变化。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动横向滑块将长设为 5。"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！现在每行有 5 个单位正方形。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 5.005,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "通过网格的每行数量与行数，理解方格总数的阵列计算规律",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在，我们用边长为 1厘米 的小正方形来铺满这个长方形。请注意观察它的排列方式。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导观察长方形内部网格阵列的结构",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我们可以看到，沿长方向每一行摆放了 4 个小正方形，而沿宽方向一共排了 3 行。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 2
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 4,
                "duration_intent": "brief",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "要求出方格的总数，并不需要逐个去数。每行有 4 个，一共有 3 行，写成乘法算式就是 4 乘以 3 等于 12 个。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "4 \\times 3 = 12 \\text{ (个)}"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\text{每行方格数} \\times \\text{行数} = \\text{方格总数}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "突出每行方格数与行数的乘法关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "如果我们改变长方形的大小，试试把每行方格数调整为 6 个，看看总数会如何变化？",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 3,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "请将每行方格数（长）修改为 6 个，观察方格总数的变化。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动长（每行方格数）滑块至 6。",
              "观察此时横向排列的方格数量。"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！现在每行有 6 个方格，共 3 行，总数变为 6×3=18 个。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 5.995,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "推导长方形面积公式，并掌握平方厘米（cm²）的使用",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "观察这个长方形，每行排了4个边长为1厘米的单位正方形，一共排了3行。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导观察长方形网格中每行方格数与行数",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "方格的总数等于每行的个数乘以行数，即 4 乘以 3 等于 12 个正方形。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "4 \\times 3 = 12"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "因为每个小正方形的面积是1平方厘米，所以长方形的面积就是12平方厘米。由此得出长方形的面积公式：面积等于长乘以宽。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\text{长方形面积} = \\text{长} \\times \\text{宽}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "强调长方形面积公式的导出过程",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "现在请你尝试调整长方形的“长”，把它更改为5厘米，看看面积会发生怎样的变化。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "intent": "提示学员尝试修改长参数",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "太棒了！长变为5厘米后，每行有5个方格，3行一共是15个小正方形，面积就是15平方厘米。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 5,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "把长方形的长调整为 5 cm",
            "hints": [
              "拖动或修改长（每行方格数）的数值滑块。",
              "将长设为 5。"
            ],
            "success_message": "成功将长调整为 5 cm！",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 5.005,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "通过实际图形辨析周长与面积的区别",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "大家看，这是一个长为4厘米、宽为3厘米的长方形。很多人容易混淆面积与周长，我们今天就来清楚地辨析它们。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦当前长方形外观",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "面积是指图形内部占有的大小，也就是用1平方厘米的单位正方形摆满它所需要的数量。4乘以3等于12，它的面积是12平方厘米。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "而周长指的是封闭图形一周边界的总长度，就像沿着它的四条边围上一圈绳子。两条长加上两条宽，周长是14厘米。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 5,
                "duration_intent": "brief",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "记住：面积测量的是铺满内部的面，用平方厘米表示；周长测量的是围成一周的线，用厘米表示。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "面积与周长的区别",
                  "items": [
                    "面积：内部覆盖的大小（如：15 cm²）",
                    "周长：一周边界的长度（如：16 cm）",
                    "单位不同：平方单位 vs 长度单位"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "将长方形的长调整为5厘米，观察面积与周长的计算变化。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动滑块将长改为5"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！现在面积是 5×3=15 平方厘米，而周长是 (5+3)×2=16 厘米。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 5.005,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      }
